# Architecture & invariants

**Three tiers:** Components (`src/components/ui/**`) → Sections
(`src/components/sections/**`) → Pages (`src/pages/**`). Compose pages from
sections; compose sections from components. Register new sections in
`src/components/sections/index.ts` and `src/registry.json`.

**i18n:** English is the default locale (no prefix). Locales are defined only in
`src/config/i18n.config.ts`. Use `t(locale, key)` and `resolveRoute(locale, path)`.
When a second locale is added, every route must also exist in
`src/pages/[locale]/x.astro` (see the Internationalization guide).

**Security:** the CSP is hash-based. No inline event handlers; avoid `is:inline`
scripts (pre-paint ones register their hash via `src/lib/csp.ts`); add third-party
origins only in `src/config/csp.config.ts`.

**Preserve (never break):** Git-based Markdown content collections, Cloudflare
Pages (+ optional R2), SEO (OG images, JSON-LD, sitemap, RSS, robots, llms.txt),
Pagefind search, Starlight docs.

**Rendering:** static Astro, no UI-framework runtime. Interactivity is a bundled
`<script>` or custom element (e.g. `landing/FeatureTabs.astro`). Add a framework
island only when truly required, with the narrowest `client:*` directive.

**Verify:** `pnpm build`, `pnpm lint` (includes `check:kpis`) and `pnpm test` must
pass (`pnpm test:e2e` for UI changes); check accessibility
(`system/globals/accessibility.md`).
